under the same licence as the H.264 / H.265 decoders), are original code by
the same author, written from the Vorbis I specification (Xiph.Org
Foundation) and RFC 3533. They do not include or derive from libvorbis,
libogg, Tremor, stb_vorbis, lewton, FFmpeg or any other Vorbis or Ogg
implementation. Xiph.Org's Vorbis test vectors are used as data only. Ogg,
Vorbis and Xiph.Org are trademarks of the Xiph.Org Foundation; this is an
independent implementation, not certified by it.

