decoder is verified against the WebM project's public VP9 test vectors, used
as data. Google offers a royalty-free patent licence for VP9 through the
WebM project, and third parties have asserted patents on VP9 as well; this
software grants no patent rights and makes no claim about whether a licence
is needed.

